{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the pages of a mysterious book called <strong>Paplion</strong>, strange monsters can be found. Those are called <strong>Papling</strong>, monsters born from paper. After being absorbed by the book, you will meet your partner <strong>Papling</strong> and together you will go in an adventure through the chapters of <strong>Paplion</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485820/extras/bookmark.gif?t=1741058679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Papling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can find more than 100 different <strong>Papling</strong> to <strong>befriend</strong> and add them to your <strong>deck</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485820/extras/013.gif?t=1741058679\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose their evolution line</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Papling</strong> have <strong>3 evolutive stages</strong>. Those that aren't in the last stage can choose between 3 different evolutions to evolve, becoming stronger and gaining <strong>new abilities</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485820/extras/evolutions.png?t=1741058679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiple paths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paplion</strong> has <strong>6 chapters,</strong> each of them with its own world to explore and you can choose in which order you will play them. Also, each of them has each own story, divided in two different paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485820/extras/portals.gif?t=1741058679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can customize the main character with different hats, suits and shoes you will find through your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485820/extras/customization.gif?t=1741058679\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3485820?t=1741058679","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3485820?t=1741058679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485820/cae583fae42f19c36ff6955627fb11c320fceaf9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741058679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485820/cae583fae42f19c36ff6955627fb11c320fceaf9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741058679","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the pages of a mysterious book called <strong>Paplion</strong>, strange monsters can be found. Those are called <strong>Papling</strong>, monsters born from paper. After being absorbed by the book, you will meet your partner <strong>Papling</strong> and together you will go in an adventure through the chapters of <strong>Paplion</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p cla